# (0.28) PTEST from the Desktop (DESK=1; the Programs menu starts with "Ptest", which is
# /BIG/PTESTBIG.PRG, 100,000 bytes): F10, Right, Enter start it from the menu; then Files 1
# (in /): "big", Enter opens /BIG, "ptestbig", Enter starts it from there. The console must
# show both runs (tests/ptestd.txt).
4000 {d43}{u43}
4400 {right}
4800 \n
7000 big
+800 \n
+1500 ptestbig
+800 \n
